{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-4-8","kind":"proposition","title":"为给定正方形作内切圆","englishTitle":"In a given square to inscribe a circle.","book":4,"number":8,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.8","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.8/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":8,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","contentId":"euclid-4-8","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b999ac22a84b412fa5cb46f3a2d8568fe673f38f0d3278fe7dc89d3c1dd7bf3","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-4-8.statement","euclid-4-8.construction.1","euclid-4-8.construction.2","euclid-4-8.proof.1","euclid-4-8.proof.2","euclid-4-8.proof.3","euclid-4-8.proof.4","euclid-4-8.proof.5","euclid-4-8.proof.6","euclid-4-8.conclusion","euclid-4-8.historical.1","euclid-4-8.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-4-8.statement","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f49c12f73f45ff892bac59aec1d4017b46d417f1767bae23901ec4e80cd69f44","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In a given square to inscribe a circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一个正方形的时间里, 输入一个圆。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"直角方形求作形内切圜"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"正方形求作形内切圆"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-8.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f79d39ea80efac2bc5699a726cd78505ee85f6f3b8a238bec6d27ec74a8cc26","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD be the given square; thus it is required to inscribe a circle in the given square ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD成为给的正方形;因此,必须在给的正方形 ABCD中加入一个圆。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-8.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94a4019528523da9630fd288310aa05ea0d6a91013d1cb4596ba8f2d1f5f46f7","citations":["euclid-1-10","euclid-1-31","euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the straight lines AD, AB be bisected at the points E, F respectively [[I. 10](/principles/euclid-1-10)], through E let EH be drawn parallel to either AB or CD, and through F let FK be drawn parallel to either AD or BC; [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)] therefore each of the figures AK, KB, AH, HD, AG, GC, BG, GD is a parallelogram, and their opposite sides are evidently equal. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AD、AB直线分别分为E、F和EH两部分,将AB和CD直线划为E和EH,将F和FK直线划为AD或BC两部分;因此,数字AK、KB、AH、HD、AG、GC、BG、GD各为平行四边形,其对面明显相等。 [[I. 10](/principles/euclid-1-10)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)] [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-8.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b3105a41f7435d58cbe7e5846b7b0c0d1f9696352b745cfaf754c3815bf33b7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AD is equal to AB, and AE is half of AD, and AF half of AB, therefore AE is equal to AF, so that the opposite sides are also equal; therefore FG is equal to GE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AD等于AB,AE等于AD的一半,AB的AF等于AF的一半,因此AE等于AF,因此,对立面也等于AF;因此,FG等于GE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-8.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e23511c43e8620472ce2b8b47f1309d88021017fc5423e7a1c59d0465265390c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that each of the straight lines GH, GK is equal to each of the straight lines FG, GE; therefore the four straight lines GE, GF, GH, GK are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,GH、GK直线的每一个都等于FG、GE直线的每一个;因此,4条直线GE、GF、GH、GK直线是彼此相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-8.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7dd4111f39799aa9535064b1673ed49d25c7da9cb1fa0cd9342321ebf9272df7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the circle described with centre G and distance one of the straight lines GE, GF, GH, GK will pass also through the remaining points."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,以G中心为主的圆圈和GE、GF、GH、GK直线之一的距离也将通过其余点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-8.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0797dfbe8e490ae9240220106a58ab964c16f86717d389e3f0566762515b900f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it will touch the straight lines AB, BC, CD, DA, because the angles at E, F, H, K are right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它将触摸到AB,BC,CD,DA直线, 因为角度在E,F,H,K是正确的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-8.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"02bd876c6cef72465ffdd799b68b5482977ba629ae49b79efd9380d7f9b30d27","citations":["euclid-3-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the circle cuts AB, BC, CD, DA, the straight line drawn at right angles to the diameter of the circle from its extremity will fall within the circle : which was proved absurd; [[III. 16](/principles/euclid-3-16)] therefore the circle described with centre G and distance one of the straight lines GE, GF, GH, GK will not cut the straight lines AB, BC, CD, DA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果圆圈切除AB,BC,CD,DA,则从圆的极限向直角至圆直径划出的直线将划入圆圈内:这证明是荒谬的;因此,以G为中心、GE线之一的圆圈和GF,GH,GK直线的距离不会划断AB,BC,CD,DA直线。 [[III. 16](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-8.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"04cd0f09bdb93dd409e836d6d86fd0a38143e317bae8b5d3f46929baf909e395","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore it will touch them, and will have been inscribed in the square ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,它将触摸它们,并将被记录在正方形 ABCD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-8.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8a498ddecbf97aed712e386984a4ad82e248499f8d84abd1738f512d36ebcaf1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the given square a circle has been inscribed. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定的正方形个圆内有一个圈子。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-8.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7946799f3930687e56d0b8b7df7ecf4ec790f05f9027163fa92b18c5885f98ad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"直角方形求作形内切圜法曰甲乙丙丁直角方形求作形内切圜先以四边各两平分于戊于己于庚于辛而作辛己戊庚两线交于壬其甲丁与乙丙既平行相等即半减线之甲辛乙己亦平行相等而甲乙与辛己亦平行相等〈一卷卅三〉依显丁丙与辛己亦平行相等甲丁乙丙戊庚俱平行相等而甲壬乙壬丙壬丁壬四俱直角形壬戊壬己壬庚壬辛四线与甲辛戊乙丁辛甲戊四线各等夫甲辛戊乙丁辛甲戊各为等线之半即与之等者壬戊壬己壬庚壬辛亦自相等次作圜以壬为心戊为界必过己庚辛而切甲丁丁丙丙乙乙甲四边〈三卷十六〉是为形内切圜"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"正方形求作形内切圆作图方法如下：甲乙丙丁正方形求作形内切圆先以四边各平分于戊于己于庚于辛而作辛己戊庚两线交于壬其甲丁与乙丙既平行相等即半减线之甲辛乙己亦平行相等而甲乙与辛己亦平行相等〈一卷卅三〉依显丁丙与辛己亦平行相等甲丁乙丙戊庚都平行相等而甲壬乙壬丙壬丁壬四都矩形壬戊壬己壬庚壬辛四线与甲辛戊乙丁辛甲戊四线各等夫甲辛戊乙丁辛甲戊各为等线之半即与之等者壬戊壬己壬庚壬辛亦自相等次作圆以壬为心戊为界必过己庚辛而切甲丁丁丙丙乙乙甲四边〈三卷十六〉是为形内切圆"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-8.source","contentId":"euclid-4-8","revisionId":"euclid-4-8@raw-5b999ac22a84b412","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e6aa3c4299d766104f07a517f9995c13fc50ac3254f11c74473ea811e9c4658","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.8/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.8\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-8:euclid-1-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-8.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"I. 10"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-8:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-8.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"I. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-8:euclid-1-34:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-8.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-34","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"I. 34"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-8:euclid-3-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-8.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"per